.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-HELP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-help
.Nd show usage for the nomad command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad help
.Nm nomad
.Fl -help
.Nm nomad
.Fl h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad help
prints the usage summary for the
.Nm nomad
command, listing every subcommand with its arguments and a short note on what
it does.
.Pp
.Fl -help
and
.Fl h
are accepted as equivalents, both as a bare command and after any other
arguments.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad help
Print the usage summary.
.It Ic nomad --help
Same as above.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1
